{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/4f1f48e9f90394c44674a1c66aba5d1b.avif?t=1756393796\" data-has-big width=1600 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a world with hundreds of creatures you\u2019ve never seen before. They swarm around you in flocks, examining you just as closely as you examine them. Explore various fantastical biomes, discover unique species, and become a bird whisperer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forage for seeds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/0bad6bd4689aab431b61f13593bbd615.poster.avif?t=1756393796\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/0bad6bd4689aab431b61f13593bbd615.webm?t=1756393796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/0bad6bd4689aab431b61f13593bbd615.mp4?t=1756393796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every biome has their own unique flora, harvest the plants, gather their seeds, and determine each bird\u2019s personal tastes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feed the birds earn their trust</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/ab672e0bec1b8459b5daecb49ead639b.poster.avif?t=1756393796\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/ab672e0bec1b8459b5daecb49ead639b.webm?t=1756393796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/ab672e0bec1b8459b5daecb49ead639b.mp4?t=1756393796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriending a bird is no easy task, get close enough to feed them, but beware of their easily startled nature. Sneak and hide in shrubbery to get a closer look, or simply observe from a distance! With enough of their favorite foods, maybe they\u2019ll even come to you on their own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect\u2026 teeth?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.poster.avif?t=1756393796\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.webm?t=1756393796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.mp4?t=1756393796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The birds are not what they seem. They\u2019ve watched and judged your every move, and hopefully they will determine that you are worthy of their gifts. Accept their teeth. Surely it\u2019s a good sign?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Upcoming Features...</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train your birds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach your new friends to follow you and listen to commands. They'll be eager to use their individual skills to help you solve puzzles around the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and shape the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The landscapes have changed drastically over the centuries, but the ancient shrines and artifacts remain. Learn how to wield their forgotten powers to mold the world around you. Perhaps by shaping your environment, you\u2019ll unlock far more secrets than you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/e446ab307c07e9b2e601741e6354f738.avif?t=1756393796\" data-has-big width=1600 height=474 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938080?t=1756393796","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/c0398e0aaed5b3db56dc067653f3e146dd0be327/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756393796","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/596323d792d6953209b91ab22291d7ed45961d8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756393796","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/596323d792d6953209b91ab22291d7ed45961d8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756393796","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/4f1f48e9f90394c44674a1c66aba5d1b.avif?t=1756393796\" data-has-big width=1600 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You live in a world with hundreds of creatures you\u2019ve never seen before. They swarm around you in flocks, examining you just as closely as you examine them. Explore various fantastical biomes, discover unique species, and become a bird whisperer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forage for seeds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=