ted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.poster.avif?t=1756393796\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.webm?t=1756393796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/fce2d986a3fc4bf14bb7f833bf67968c.mp4?t=1756393796\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The birds are not what they seem. They\u2019ve watched and judged your every move, and hopefully they will determine that you are worthy of their gifts. Accept their teeth. Surely it\u2019s a good sign?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Upcoming Features...</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train your birds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach your new friends to follow you and listen to commands. They'll be eager to use their individual skills to help you solve puzzles around the map!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and shape the world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The landscapes have changed drastically over the centuries, but the ancient shrines and artifacts remain. Learn how to wield their forgotten powers to mold the world around you. Perhaps by shaping your environment, you\u2019ll unlock far more secrets than you expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938080/extras/e446ab307c07e9b2e601741e6354f738.avif?t=1756393796\" data-has-big width=1600 height=474 /></span></p>","developers":["Stone Quail Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps